1 - About
    -----

    "trinkets" is a small collection
    of focused tools for browser
    layout, monospaced text shaping,
    and marked-up source rendering.

    Each tool is independent. Open a
    browser entry point directly, or
    install the Python tool on its
    own.


2 - Cabinet
    -------

    ┌──────────┬──────────────────────┐
    │css2letter│ A printable DIN 5008 │
    │          │ letter layout with   │
    │          │ automatic pagination.│
    ├──────────┼──────────────────────┤
    │monosetter│ A browser typesetter │
    │          │ for fixed-width text │
    │          │ and comment boxes.   │
    ├──────────┼──────────────────────┤
    │monotyper │ A strict compiler for│
    │          │ marked-up Rocq / Coq │
    │          │ source comments.     │
    └──────────┴──────────────────────┘

    Each cabinet contains its own
    README.md with usage, requirements,
    and a map of its parts.


